{
  "run_id": "PMC11355469__problem_constrained__web_trend_o1_ground_b_o3mini__s1",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A stable, adherent oxide scale is the dominant mechanism governing overall wear resistance and microscopic deformation in FeNiCrCoCu coatings during high-temperature sliding.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidation at 800 °C in low-partial-pressure oxygen for 1 hour will form a continuous, adherent oxide scale on the FeNiCrCoCu coating.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-oxidation scale may be a spinel or mixed oxide.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::036::4_4_oxidation_thermodynamics"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "An intact oxide scale limits direct metallic contact during sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::019::3_4_worn_track_morphology_and_wear_mecha"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide scale distributes the applied load and reduces local stress concentrations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing direct contact and local stress concentrations reduces wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::019::3_4_worn_track_morphology_and_wear_mecha"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing direct contact and local stress concentrations limits subsurface plastic deformation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::019::3_4_worn_track_morphology_and_wear_mecha"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "An oxide layer generated dynamically by frictional heating can crack under prolonged tribological loading.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::019::3_4_worn_track_morphology_and_wear_mecha"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cracking of a dynamically formed oxide layer makes it less protective and is associated with increased wear and deformation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::019::3_4_worn_track_morphology_and_wear_mecha"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "At approximately 400 °C under otherwise identical sliding conditions, the pre-oxidized coating will have a lower wear rate than the as-deposited coating.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::019::3_4_worn_track_morphology_and_wear_mecha"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "At approximately 400 °C under otherwise identical sliding conditions, the pre-oxidized coating will exhibit less subsurface plastic deformation than the as-deposited coating.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::019::3_4_worn_track_morphology_and_wear_mecha"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sliding near 400 °C under representative normal loads mimics the intended high-temperature service environment.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The predicted benefit may disappear at lower temperatures if a protective oxide does not form or remain stable.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The predicted benefit may disappear under extreme thermal cycling if the protective oxide becomes unstable.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
